<title>ISRAEL: Doctor says three Palestinians dead, 300 wounded.</title>
<headline>Doctor says three Palestinians dead, 300 wounded.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli soldiers killed three Palestinians and wounded about 300 during clashes on Wednesday, a hospital doctor said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have three (dead people) and about 300 injured,&quot; Doctor Mohammad Aideh of Ramallah hospital told Israel Radio. He could not say whether the dead were Palestinian protesters or policemen.</p>
